WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.272
Follow Start Here in order: Follow Start Here in order. Open Module 1 online before you install tools. Pick one course and stay with it. Use Mark done so your path updates.

2
00:00:14.122 --> 00:00:26.266
Lessons, quizzes, and progress: Read each lesson, then take the module quiz. Continue banners bring you back where you left off. Certificates unlock when every module is complete.

3
00:00:27.116 --> 00:00:37.892
Guest mode vs free account: Guest progress stays in this browser. A free account can sync when the cloud is up. Keep guest progress as a backup on free hosting.

4
00:00:38.742 --> 00:00:50.910
Practice habits that stick: Type the examples — do not only read them. Break big tasks into tiny checkpoints. When stuck, re-read the tip boxes, then open Help.

5
00:00:51.760 --> 00:01:03.400
You are ready: You are ready. Go to Start Here, choose a course, and open Module 1. Watch the Python or C sharp install video when you code locally.
